Waypoint: what the LICENSE does not cover

Mod listings
  Everything about a listed mod belongs to its author: the name, summary, description, screenshots,
  credits, permission notes and other details in mods/*.json, and the mod's files, which stay in the
  author's own GitHub repository. By adding a mod, its author lets Waypoint display these details
  and link to the files. Authors can change or remove their listing at any time. The mod's own
  license and permissions say what others may do with it.

Fonts (assets/fonts)
  Fraunces, Inter and JetBrains Mono are used under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Their licenses
  are in assets/fonts/OFL-*.txt.

Background picture (assets/vista.jpg)
  The Skyrim mountain artwork belongs to Bethesda Softworks. The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim is a
  trademark of ZeniMax Media Inc. Waypoint is a free fan site, not affiliated with or endorsed by
  Bethesda or ZeniMax, and uses the picture only as page decoration. It is not covered by the LICENSE.

Services the site uses
  GitHub (hosting, releases, Discussions), giscus (comments), Cloudflare Workers (live stats),
  VirusTotal and ClamAV (virus scans) are run by their own owners under their own terms. None of
  their code is included here.
